    "detailed_description": "<strong>The Deep Web.</strong> This place is beyond description \u2014 you have to see it for yourself. Something that did not pass filters of humanity. Everyone here can finally take off their masks and show themself. Friends or enemies, knowledge or ignorance, life and death \u2014 here, everyone can find exactly what he searches for.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975620/extras/6b86b5ae8a4d01efe592ed86cd2d82ff.poster.avif?t=1750074042\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975620/extras/6b86b5ae8a4d01efe592ed86cd2d82ff.webp?t=1750074042\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><strong>Project DeepWeb</strong> is a deep web exploration simulator. Puzzles are on the surface but answers are deep inside. You\u2019re going to discover hundreds of websites and dozens of puzzles, go through every Internet level \u2014 all to achieve your objective. And if you\u2019re brave enough to dig a little deeper, you may see something that was supposed to stay hidden forever.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975620/extras/6b86b5ae8a4d01efe592ed86cd2d82ff.poster.avif?t=1750074042\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975620/extras/6b86b5ae8a4d01efe592ed86cd2d82ff.webp?t=1750074042\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><strong>The world of the game</strong> is filled with stories and characters, personal tragedies and acts of ruthlessness. Don\u2019t get friendly with anyone here, because you\u2019re just a silent viewer and you\u2019re here only to save your friend\u2026 and yourself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the Deep Web. It's showtime!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975620/extras/cafd2883cff363fee127873b57c4c51d.poster.avif?t=1750074042\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975620/extras/cafd2883cff363fee127873b57c4c51d.webm?t=1750074042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/975620/extras/cafd2883cff363fee127873b57c4c51d.mp4?t=1750074042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
